{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>PicPost EZ 把拍照、備註與分享整合在同一個應用程式內，使用者拍照後可即時為照片加上文字備註，日後瀏覽相簿時便能重溫當時記錄的想法。無論是旅遊途中的所見所聞、日常生活片段，還是需要整理多張照片再發佈到社交平台的內容創作者，都適合使用。應用程式無需註冊帳戶，原價 US $1.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>拍照備註合併一次分享</h2>\n<p>內建相機支援前後鏡頭切換與雙指縮放，照片除存入 Apple Photos，亦保留在 PicPost 相簿內。使用者可為單張照片加上備註，左右滑動即可瀏覽照片與文字；選取多張照片時，備註會自動合併成一段文字，方便一次過分享至 Threads、Instagram 或通訊軟件。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-14.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-15.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2556x1179bb.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：PicPost EZ</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T08:31:55.783122+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":349,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T08:19:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T08:37:45.322152+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:27:49.732991+00:00","content_hash":"b94341c648b14af6010ca561a368d81b122b6b66177b1e03e95b24b1f402c3f0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}